        ('Combine rules', 'allowed = member and spend >= 50\nready = pickup or has_address\nmissing = not has_address', 'and requires both conditions, or requires at least one, and not reverses a truth value. Name complicated conditions and inspect their parts when debugging. Use Boolean True and False without quotes.'),
        ('Accumulate and filter', 'total = 0\nlarge = []\nfor value in values:\n    total += value\n    if value >= 20:\n        large.append(value)', 'Initialise accumulators before the loop. Put only repeated work inside it. A nested if needs an additional indentation level. Print a final total after the loop if you want one summary.'),
