        ('Defaults and keywords', 'def final(amount, fee=4, discount=0):\n    return amount + fee - discount\n\nresult = final(40, discount=5)', 'Defaults apply only to omitted arguments. Keyword arguments document which setting each value belongs to. Avoid mutable default lists or dictionaries because they would be shared between calls.'),
