        ('Missing is different from zero', 'valid = [x for x in values if x is not None]\nmissing_count = len(values) - len(valid)', 'Filter explicitly for None if that is the missing-data marker. Filtering on truthiness also removes zero. Document excluded data and define what happens when no valid observations remain.'),
